1
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:07,981
Once you were everything…

2
00:00:10,081 --> 00:00:12,901
Then the moment came - you split away…

3
00:00:15,901 --> 00:00:16,861
You stayed alone…

4
00:00:18,901 --> 00:00:19,541
But one day…

5
00:00:21,581 --> 00:00:22,202
You return…

6
00:00:28,842 --> 00:00:30,742
Everything led me in spirals,

7
00:00:31,662 --> 00:00:34,702
Through fear, through scars, through borrowed morals.

8
00:00:35,382 --> 00:00:37,543
But in every step there was a turn,

9
00:00:38,383 --> 00:00:40,983
Not a hero - just a living form.

10
00:00:41,743 --> 00:00:44,023
Not control, not the peak of the way,

11
00:00:45,203 --> 00:00:47,643
Just a rhythm that teaches to stay.

12
00:00:48,643 --> 00:00:51,143
Not an answer, not victory’s cry -

13
00:00:51,243 --> 00:00:53,604
Only silence.

14
00:00:54,684 --> 00:00:55,484
Only now.

15
00:00:55,704 --> 00:00:58,704
The dream brings me back to the place of light,

16
00:00:59,144 --> 00:01:02,324
Where there’s no beginning, no end, no fight.

17
00:01:02,544 --> 00:01:05,704
Where time whispers inside the line:

18
00:01:05,724 --> 00:01:07,205
“You were everywhere -

19
00:01:07,445 --> 00:01:08,725
but you lived inside.”

20
00:01:14,465 --> 00:01:17,685
I accept the world - a light with no frame,

21
00:01:17,965 --> 00:01:21,246
No labels, no borders, no names.

22
00:01:21,306 --> 00:01:24,446
Not division, not rules to obey,

23
00:01:24,606 --> 00:01:27,786
Just a silence that speaks its own way.

24
00:01:27,806 --> 00:01:30,606
I see now - the world isn’t fear or blame,

25
00:01:30,686 --> 00:01:34,786
It’s a depth where one string remains.

26
00:01:35,106 --> 00:01:38,347
Not a struggle, not someone else’s drive -

27
00:01:38,967 --> 00:01:41,767
Just the flow

28
00:01:41,807 --> 00:01:49,127
that is always alive.

29
00:01:56,568 --> 00:01:58,768
No borders - only interlace,

30
00:01:59,988 --> 00:02:02,308
No summit - just a quiet rise.

31
00:02:03,428 --> 00:02:05,789
No reason - only reflection,

32
00:02:06,829 --> 00:02:09,109
No conflict - just dissolution.

33
00:02:10,269 --> 00:02:12,429
No limit where “I” was named,

34
00:02:13,589 --> 00:02:15,709
All is one - the seeker stayed.

35
00:02:17,089 --> 00:02:19,349
No difference - only depth,

36
00:02:20,370 --> 00:02:22,870
Not in pieces - a single thread.

37
00:02:24,830 --> 00:02:27,850
The dream brings me back to the place of light,

38
00:02:28,290 --> 00:02:31,430
Where there’s no beginning, no end, no fight.

39
00:02:31,690 --> 00:02:34,830
Where time whispers inside the line:

40
00:02:34,850 --> 00:02:36,251
“You were everywhere -

41
00:02:36,611 --> 00:02:43,371
but you lived inside.”

42
00:02:43,631 --> 00:02:47,311
I accept the world - a light with no frame,

43
00:02:47,351 --> 00:02:50,232
No labels, no borders, no names.

44
00:02:50,472 --> 00:02:53,632
Not division, not rules to obey,

45
00:02:53,772 --> 00:02:57,112
Just a silence that speaks its own way.

46
00:02:57,452 --> 00:03:02,492
I see now - the world isn’t fear or blame,

47
00:03:02,652 --> 00:03:06,813
It’s a depth where one string remains.

48
00:03:06,853 --> 00:03:11,213
Not a struggle, not someone else’s drive -

49
00:03:11,233 --> 00:03:11,713
Just the flow

50
00:03:11,733 --> 00:03:25,314
that is always alive.

51
00:03:25,394 --> 00:03:27,934
No control, no separation,

52
00:03:29,054 --> 00:03:31,414
Only light and gentle motion.

53
00:03:32,394 --> 00:03:35,015
Not an ending, not a start -

54
00:03:35,495 --> 00:03:38,415
Only what was sounding in the dark.

55
00:03:38,615 --> 00:03:41,735
The world grows quiet - yet lives in my chest,

56
00:03:42,015 --> 00:03:44,995
Where every road turns inward, not west.

57
00:03:45,655 --> 00:03:48,696
No beginning, no “why” to prove -

58
00:03:48,716 --> 00:03:49,816
Only silence…

59
00:03:51,216 --> 00:03:51,776
And truth.

60
00:03:52,976 --> 00:03:56,596
No “me”.

61
00:03:56,696 --> 00:03:57,296
No “you”.

62
00:03:59,836 --> 00:04:00,656
Only - all.

63
00:04:03,276 --> 00:04:34,339
Only - us.

